          "settings": {
            "asset": "",
            "icon": "zap",
            "heading": "How It Works",
            "body": "<p>After 40, your vessels make less nitric oxide, the signal that helps them relax. CoQ10 levels drop too. Beetroot supplies dietary nitrates your body turns into nitric oxide, garlic and nattokinase support healthy blood flow, CoQ10 fuels heart cells, and vitamin K2 helps direct calcium to your bones.*</p>",
            "open": false
          }
